Hi everyone,

I'm trying to get Linux up on an sbc8260.  I'm working with Linux-2.4.16
and PPCBoot-1.1.0.  I'm booting from the flash simm on the sbc8260 and
I'm using the 33mhz oscillator.

My problem is that once PPCBoot has passed control to Linux I don't get
any further output to the console (connected to the serial line).  Has
anyone seen this before or have any idea what I might be doing wrong?

I've added the output from the boot session below as well as my
.config.  Also, if anyone has a working .config for the sbc8260 that
they could share I'd really appreciate that.  It would let me run a
sanity check on the rest of my configuration.

Thanks,
Andy

